  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public administration reform - PDF 2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reform inom den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen - PDF 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta bidrag ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r preparat program och bed&#xf6;mningar, externa bed&#xf6;mningar, &#xf6;vervakning, utv&#xe4;rderingar, politiska studier och ger r&#xe5;d i form av konsulter i samband med den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen reformprocessen . Syftet med bidraget &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kvaliteten p&#xe5; utvecklingssamarbete  inom omr&#xe5;det reformer offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen. Efter inf&#xf6;randet av det nya finansiella systemet och dess krav, i st&#xe4;llet f&#xf6;r komponent som knyts till Administration Reform allm&#xe4;nheten, &#xe4;r det nu n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndigt att &#xf6;ppna ett nytt bidrag (beslut om inr&#xe4;ttande av PDF bifogas).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is to be used for programme preparations and assessments, external appraisals, monitoring, evaluations, policy studies and advises in the form of consultancies related to the Public Administration Reform process. The purpose of the contribution is to increase the quality of the development cooperation activities in the area of public administration reforms. Following the introduction of the new financial system and its requirements, instead of the component related to the Public Administration Reform, it is now necessary to open a new contribution (decision on the establishment of the PDF is attached).</narrative>
  </description>
